// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - PPDBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P978594754" "Put down Interrogator Matherson"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1307352664" "Matherson refused to tell you any information on the project."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2939571164" "Matherson refused to talk, forcing you to take him back as your prisoner."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1490033514" "Deliver Matherson to Wardog"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3064611686" "Kiddo, you got a good haul in there! Wardog would be interested in seein' this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2308343990" "So, another one of the PPD in our clutches? I'll take good care of Matherson, {HeroName}. I remember his brother very well, back in the academy. I believe I know just the thing that will get him to tell us everything he knows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1187298488" "Kiddo, I gotta say, I've seen cold before, but Wardog always seems to hogwash the cold that I thought I've seen. I watched him drag that Matherson fella away and tell me to be ready to move. Thing is though, Wardog <i>ain't</i> the coldest thing I ever saw. You wanna know what was the worst? I'll tell ya. It was back in Rome, you know, before it was destroyed. I was servin' in the Italian militia, we were holdin' out against hordes of Devouring Earth. It was the third or fourth time in my life that I was pretty sure I was gonna die.<br><br>I was laying in a pile of debris, watchin' the Devouring Earth charge into the main city. And you know who I see, watchin' the entire scene from a skyscraper?<br><br><i>Cole</i>. I thought we were all saved! Here was that guy everyone was talkin' about. And you know what he did? He <i>watched</i> Rome <i>burn</i>. When all hope was just about lost, he swooped in there, like some sorta hero. He saved everyone else who was left, but of course, the Devouring Earth destroyed whatever was left of Rome's government, meanin' big bad Cole had no competition.<br><br>Me? I survived, 'course, but that's another story. We got bigger fish to fry now."
// RandomFameString :
"P3958075051" "string"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Radio 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2715802519" "{HeroName}, good to hear from you. I have Matherson listening in. He doesn't believe that we have his siblings. He should know, however, that we are always serious when it comes to family. Do me a favor and get one of them to say a little something."
// Answer Text :
"P956506119" "(Turn and get one of the siblings to speak up)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3502759164" "<color orange>You can hear Matherson plead in the background.</color><br><br>It looks like Matherson is starting to get the idea. I wonder if he knows that we have the area rigged with explosives? It's no issue for us to let it blow. Even if Beholder can't read Matherson's mind, I'm sure we can use this as an example. What do you think, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P41473809" "It seems easy enough to me. Maybe Matherson should just give us the information."
// Page GiveUs Text :
"P383086398" "<color orange>You can hear Matherson break down as he begins to reveal everything about where you can find information on Neuron's project.</color><br><br>See, that wasn't that hard, was it? This is a good lesson to learn. All men, even the most corrupt, are tied to their family. Thank you, Matherson, for giving us this information.<br><br><color orange>You hear the sound of a gunshot, followed by a body slumping to the ground. Wardog comes back over the phone.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, kill them and meet back with Vagabond. We have the information needed to bring justice to our men."
// Answer Text :
"P1029810121" "Roger."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4038379268" "Men have to do a lotta bad things in war, kiddo. It ain't that we <i>want</i> to do it, but it's that we gotta. It's what makes us different from the Wardens. Why, back when I served in Italy, we had to let one of the smaller villages get devoured by Hamidon, just so we could establish a better base over in Milan. It's what had to be done. But some fools went out themselves to try to save that village, only to go get killed. Now what good is that gonna do?<br><br>I tell ya this because we gotta do something real bad to do somethin' real good, but I don't think you're gonna have a problem with it. Matherson isn't talkin' about where we can find the info on what our boys have, so we gotta take drastic actions."
// AcceptString :
"P2713819253" "What sort of actions?"
// SendOffString :
"P1556755903" "Family actions, kiddo. We're gonna kidnap Matherson's brother and sister and do the whole threaten routine. If Matherson knows what's best for them, he'll talk.<br><br>Wardog has their location; turns out they've got connections with the Syndicate. Unfortunately for us, they happen to be members of the Syndicate who <i>aren't</i> workin' for us. That's your cue, kiddo, to go wipe the floor with a ton of them suits in order to get us that man's family. We got a small part of the tunnels you can bring 'em to. When you get there, radio in to Wardog and we'll get our little deal going."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3929652046" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Closest to the Heart</color>"

