// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1416150964" "You've settled matters with the Mathersons. Time to move forward with the next part of the plan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1649905325" "Wardog is busy holding some sort of funeral for Matherson. I gotta tell ya kiddo, out of everyone I've met, Wardog is the one that makes me the most confused. He'll shoot the guy and order his family to be killed, then give him a funeral? Weirdest funeral I've ever been to, I'll tell ya that. But we got what we needed, which is the location of the lab where we can find the info that our boys need.<br><br>I think you can see what's gonna happen next; we're gonna have ourselves a good old fashioned raid!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2085533365" "{HeroName}, what's going on? There's a mess about the BAF and Neuron is refusing to acknowledge any of my questions."
// Answer Text :
"P923427680" "Marchand, do you know about the experiments in the BAF?"
// Page Experiments Text :
"P205700947" "Experiments? What experiments? The BAF is not used in that sort of way. It's a facility where we can change those who try to destroy Praetoria. A place for redemption, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P845240164" "That isn't what Neuron is using it for. (Explain the situation)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P4127174776" "Hrm... This is disturbing, to say the least. And again, paints us into a corner. You can't exactly turn on those two fellows of yours, not now. As well, I'm curious about this plan that this man, Wardog, has. Alright, here is my proposal, {HeroName}. Obviously Neuron is up to something. When you find the details on his plans, send them to me. We won't be able to stop the Resistance from using them, but I believe this entire mess was caused by Neuron's mad experiments. If I can have definitive proof, I can make a move against him."
// Answer Text :
"P4289950211" "I'll do what I can."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2574956451" "Here's the plan, kiddo. You, me, and Hatchet are gonna storm the lab that Matherson blabbed about. We gotta do three things. First, we gotta get any information we can about the sickness our boys have. Second, we gotta destroy these devices they got in the lab, they use 'em to call in for reinforcements - we ain't gettin' outta there alive if we don't do that. Lastly, we gotta take down a guy named Interrogator Crichton. Sounds simple enough, eh?"
// AcceptString :
"P1624664387" "As long as nothing goes wrong."
// SendOffString :
"P776091051" "Trust me, the three of us workin' together, nothin'll go wrong! This will just be like that time I served up in Canada with some of them mounties. They sure did put up a good fight against some of Hamidon's monsters, I'll tell you that much. But we can go over old war stories later on, eh? We'll meet ya at the lab!<br><br><color yellow>Those Loyalists who have gone undercover would do well to speak with Provost Marchand about events that are happening.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3605044316" "Assault the lab with Hatchet and Vagabond"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2844308872" "Don't just sit around, we gotta get movin' kiddo!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2457718009" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: The Great Assault</color>"

