"P3014723788" "Good job, kiddo. Well, {HeroName}. Yeah, I got your name in my head now, I ain't gonna forget it. You and me, we served together, officially.<br><br>Wardog said the notes detail how to trigger the disease in them boys. He said it's gonna help bring his big plan to completion, or somethin'. I don't really know what it is yet, but it appears you're gonna know real soon. He wants ya to help him see this big plan to the end."

